    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "offset": 110,
      "field_bytes": 64,
      "english": "Baker: I never asked to be squad leader,\\  but I had no choice.^",
      "korean": "베이커: 원한 건 아니지만,\\  선택권은 없었다.^",
      "encoded_len": 28,
      "replacement_hex": "5477e83a2073f1202320623bdf4c2c5c20205dea28742068693d2e2020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "offset": 207,
      "field_bytes": 56,
      "english": "Baker: Now I've got thirteen soldiers under my command.^",
      "korean": "베이커: 이제 열세 명을 지휘한다.^",
      "encoded_len": 20,
      "replacement_hex": "5477e83a2077bf206c5f20507520dffcf13d2e2020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "offset": 296,
      "field_bytes": 91,
      "english": "Baker: Thirteen men depending on me to make the right\\  decisions and not get them killed.^",
      "korean": "베이커: 내가 옳은 결정을 내려\\  살아남게 해주길 바라는 열세 명.^",
      "encoded_len": 39,
      "replacement_hex": "5477e83a203522206f742026a1752035475c20205a62302420f6c72a20524538206c5f20502e202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "offset": 420,
      "field_bytes": 80,
      "english": "Baker: Thirteen families relying on me to bring their\\  husbands and sons home.^",
      "korean": "베이커: 남편과 아들이 돌아오길\\  기다리는 열세 가족.^",
      "encoded_len": 32,
      "replacement_hex": "5477e83a2030ed27206243772042626d2a5c2020293d4a38206c5f2022c02e2020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "offset": 533,
      "field_bytes": 17,
      "english": "Baker: Thirteen.^",
      "korean": "베이커: 13.^",
      "encoded_len": 9,
      "replacement_hex": "5477e83a2031332e20202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "offset": 583,
      "field_bytes": 39,
      "english": "Baker: Thirteen is not a lucky number.^",
      "korean": "베이커: 13은 불길한 숫자다.^",
      "encoded_len": 18,
      "replacement_hex": "5477e83a2031337420562af12061793d2e2020202020202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "offset": 655,
      "field_bytes": 15,
      "english": "Mac: Stand up!^",
      "korean": "맥: 기립!^",
      "encoded_len": 7,
      "replacement_hex": "4d3a20294b2120202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "offset": 703,
      "field_bytes": 14,
      "english": "Mac: Hook up!^",
      "korean": "맥: 결속!^",
      "encoded_len": 7,
      "replacement_hex": "4d3a20266021202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "offset": 750,
      "field_bytes": 27,
      "english": "Mac: Check your equipment!^",
      "korean": "맥: 장비 확인!^",
      "encoded_len": 10,
      "replacement_hex": "4d3a207a5720fb782120202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "offset": 810,
      "field_bytes": 83,
      "english": "Mac: Remember!  This squad sticks together!\\  Once you hit the ground, find Baker!^",
      "korean": "맥: 기억해! 분대는 함께 움직인다!\\  착지하면 베이커를 찾아!^",
      "encoded_len": 37,
      "replacement_hex": "4d3a202967f62120553e3820f42b2072e0783d215c2020e2dfef4f205477e84920e46221202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "offset": 926,
      "field_bytes": 16,
      "english": "Mac: Sound Off!^",
      "korean": "맥: 번호!^",
      "encoded_len": 7,
      "replacement_hex": "4d3a2053f9212020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "offset": 975,
      "field_bytes": 37,
      "english": "Fourteen OK!\\Thirteen OK!\\Twelve OK!^",
