      "replacement_hex": "e94a6e20ee2521202020202020202020202020202020205e"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "offset": 1102,
      "field_bytes": 70,
      "english": "Garnett: Lets get the hell out of here!\\  Allen: We gotta jump Sarge!^",
      "korean": "가넷: 여기서 나가자!\\  앨런: 중사님, 뛰어야 해요!^",
